        skos:prefLabel "t050 — Novak2026 (largest paired-site PAIS biopsy series) reinforces h0007's lesion (P1) and single-protocol cross-trigger convergence (P4), nudges the non-length-dependent pattern (P2), and surfaces the first SFN-specificity caveat (hEDS dysautonomia shows comparable small-fiber loss)" ;
