<http://example.org/project/inquiry/immune-state-shift-causal-landscape> {
    <http://example.org/project/concept/autonomic-dysfunction> sci:feedsInto <http://example.org/project/concept/pais-outcome> .
    <http://example.org/project/concept/immune-autonomic-feedback-loop> a sci:Unknown .
