    <http://example.org/project/concept/impaired-o2-delivery-extraction> sci:feedsInto <http://example.org/project/concept/pais-outcome> .
    <http://example.org/project/concept/metabolic-mitochondrial-dysfunction> sci:feedsInto <http://example.org/project/concept/pais-outcome> .
    <http://example.org/project/concept/pais-outcome> sci:boundaryRole sci:BoundaryOut .
    <http://example.org/project/concept/persistent-antigen-fragment-burden> sci:boundaryRole sci:BoundaryIn ;
        sci:feedsInto <http://example.org/project/concept/persistent-immune-state-displacement> .
    <http://example.org/project/concept/persistent-immune-state-displacement> sci:feedsInto <http://example.org/project/concept/metabolic-mitochondrial-dysfunction>,
            <http://example.org/project/concept/pais-outcome>,
            <http://example.org/project/concept/small-fiber-neuropathy-dysautonomia>,
